!/data/*
!/external/*
Release/
Debug/
# Negate the Debug/ rule for .planning/debug/ — those are forensic
# investigation notes (bisect logs, CODEX consults, bug triage queues)
# with high archival value, accidentally caught by the global Debug/
# rule meant for Visual Studio build outputs.
!/.planning/debug/
RelWithDbgInfo/
tmp/
bin/
# `bin/` above already excludes bin/Release/utinni.cfg and bin/Release/ut.ini
# (the build outputs that hold local-machine config: SWGEmu client path, login
# server host/port). data/utinni.cfg MUST ship blank per CON-D-01 (C-14 fix in
# Phase 02; verified by 02-VERIFICATION.md SC #3). Never check in localhost
# login settings — they belong only in the build-output copies. See
# scripts/local-test-setup.ps1 for the seeded-bin/Release pattern.
obj/
# Release-only MSI staging: release.yml stages the pinned TheJawaToolbox build into
# installer/Payload/ before the IncludeTjt MSI build. Never committed.
installer/Payload/
ipch/
.vs/
*.sdf
*.suo
*.exe
*.tlog
*.log
*.filters
*.opensdf
*.pdb
*.obj
*.lastbuildstate
# Phase 6 (06-05 / D-16(d), CON-O-05): the CppSharp post-build step on UtinniCore.vcxproj
# regenerates these on every build. Std.cs + UtinniCore.cs are CppSharp-generated output, so
# they are gitignored. StdEdited.cs is the hand-curated companion and IS committed (it holds
# manual edits CppSharp must not overwrite -- do not add it here).
# (UtinniCore.cs is also force-added as a checked-in baseline despite this ignore line.)
/UtinniCoreDotNet/Generated/Std-symbols.cpp
/UtinniCoreDotNet/Generated/UtinniCore-symbols.cpp
/UtinniCoreDotNet/Generated/Std.cs
/UtinniCoreDotNet/Generated/UtinniCore.cs
*.aps
# Output artifact from scripts/audit-utinni-rvas.ps1 (default -OutCsv path).
# Per-machine snapshot of SWGEmu.exe RVA state; not a build-output but
# still local-machine state. Tool is checked in; its CSV output is not.
scripts/rva-audit.csv
# GSD project-level config holds API keys (brave_search, firecrawl, exa_search)
# as plaintext. Never commit. See /gsd-config --integrations to (re)seed locally.
/.planning/config.json
# Claude Code's worktree-isolation working directories. Ephemeral; cleaned up
# by the runtime after agent runs. Never commit.
/.claude/
# Phase 6 D-05 / 06-02 Task 1: vcpkg manifest-mode install target.
# Populated by `vcpkg install --triplet x86-windows` against vcpkg.json at the
# repo root; cached by CI keyed on hashFiles('vcpkg.json'). Never committed.
/vcpkg_installed/
# Phase 12 (12-01): the lifted SOE build-tools tree under tools/ uses an OutDir of
# tools/compile/win32/<Tool>/<Config>/ (per the lifted vcxproj OutDir macros). The
# Debug/ and Release/ rules above only match those leaf dir NAMES, not the compile/
# parent, and lifted static-lib build outputs (*.lib) are NOT covered by the global
# rules. Ignore the whole compiled-output root so no built TreeFileBuilder_d.exe /
# *.lib / intermediates are ever committed. The lifted *input* zlib.lib under
# tools/src/external/.../zlib/lib/ is NOT under compile/ and remains tracked.
/tools/compile/
